# Direct calls to the Cursor-owned Victoria API.
# Leave unset to use the default http://127.0.0.1:8787 (see src/lib/victoria-api.ts).
# During npm run dev you can also leave this empty and rely on Vite's /api proxy
# by setting VITE_API_URL= (empty) — only if you change the client to use relative URLs.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
